    "text": "KCRG.com\nwebsite\nWinneshiek County, Iowa\nK9 Deputy McCoy retires from Winneshiek County\nBy KCRG Staff,\n1 days agoWINNESHIEK COUNTY, Iowa (KCRG) - K9 McCoy is retiring after nine years of service as an active patrol dog in Winneshiek County. K9 Deputy McCoy, a Belgian Malinois, was born in the Slovak Republic on May 24, 2014. 89-year-old Betty McCoy gave a donation to pay for a new patrol...",
